1
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:10,000
Long, long ago, in the city of Susa, there lived a very powerful king. His name was King Xerxes.

2
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:17,580
The king chose a beautiful, kind young woman to be his queen. Her name was Esther.

3
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:25,970
Hmph! I am the king's most important man! Everyone must bow down to me!

4
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:32,490
But Mordecai bowed only to God, not to Haman. Haman stomped his feet in anger!

5
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:42,500
O king... there are some people who don't keep your laws. Why not... let me get rid of them?

6
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:49,860
Hmm... very well. Take my ring. Do as you see fit.

7
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:58,280
Esther, you must ask the king to save us! Maybe this is why you became queen, for a time just like this!

8
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:03,140
But... anyone who goes to the king without being called could die...

9
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:16,380
All right. Please pray for me. I will go to the king, even if it's dangerous!

10
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:24,740
Step by step, Esther climbed the palace stairs... What would the king do?

11
00:01:31,990 --> 00:01:38,380
Queen Esther! You've come. What is it you want? Even half my kingdom, it's yours!

12
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:43,390
My king, will you come to my banquet? And bring Haman too.

13
00:01:46,590 --> 00:01:50,980
My king... someone wants to destroy me, and all my people!

14
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:54,330
What?! Who is he? Who would dare?

15
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:58,180
It's him! This wicked man, Haman!

16
00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:02,810
No, no, no... please, my king, have mercy!

17
00:02:05,410 --> 00:02:12,150
The king had Haman taken away. God's people were saved! Everyone sang and danced for joy!

18
00:02:14,230 --> 00:02:20,410
Esther was scared, but she chose to be brave and to trust God. You can too!
